1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,393
The Great President.
伟大的总统。

2
00:00:03,393 --> 00:00:33,720
As the founder of the republic, the president had many good qualities. Before coming to power, he was a generous lawyer. He was willing to selflessly help everyone who turned to him.
作为共和国的创建者，这位总统具有许多优秀品质。执政之前，他是一位慷慨的律师。他愿意无私地帮助每一个向他求助的人。

3
00:00:33,720 --> 00:01:17,980
He accepted no fee to offer legal guidance and opinions to those who were out of work or uneducated. Later, believing all mankind to be equal, he devoted himself to stopping the unfair anti-black laws. He set up the Black Youth League and was voted to be the leader.
他提供法律指导和意见，不收取费用，帮助那些失业或没有受过教育的人。后来，由于相信所有人都应平等，他致力于废除不公正的反黑人法律。他成立了黑人青年联盟，并被选为领导人。

4
00:01:17,980 --> 00:02:20,973
However, though he kept peaceful principles without violence and terror, his mean enemies still blew up his house and attacked his relatives, and he himself couldn’t escape being sentenced to 30 years in prison. Not fearing the prison guards’ cruelty, he kept active and begged no mercy from them. As a matter of fact, he was always hopeful and never lost heart during the stage even though he was in trouble.
然而，尽管他坚持和平原则，反对暴力和恐怖行为，卑鄙的敌人仍炸毁他的房子，袭击他的亲人，而他自己也没能逃过被判30年监禁的命运。他不畏惧狱警的残酷，保持积极，从不向他们乞求怜悯。事实上，在那段时期，他始终充满希望，从不灰心，即使身处困境。

5
00:02:20,973 --> 00:02:32,233
Finally, people rewarded him with the leader’s position and a gold blanket.
最后，人们以领袖的位置和一条金色毯子作为对他的回报。
